                                                                  <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2026-10-14"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                  <http://purl.org/pav/providedBy> "https://www.uniprot.org" ;
                                                                  rdfs:comment "General: Cannot find any article or acceptable evidence to name a specific adenylate cyclase playing a role in OXM-dependent regulation of insulin production via GLP1R. The problem is that OXM is a biased agonist of GLP1R, i.e. binds the receptor as GLP1 but downstream effects are different."^^xsd:string .


